# Celestial Armor's indestructible half, apart from hexproof: Wrath of God does not target, so only "indestructible until end of turn" saves
# the creature. Bot2 casts Wrath of God on turn 2; in response Bot1 flashes in Celestial Armor, which attaches to Elvish Mystic and makes
# it indestructible before the Wrath resolves (the ability and the spell resolve in that order). The Mystic survives; Bot2's own
# Ornithopter (the positive control) is destroyed. The Armor stays on the Mystic.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Elvish Mystic
Celestial Armor
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Wrath of God
Island
Island x12

